OL,3,GNEWSABelfast solicitor to represent
OL,4,Asuspected mob boss Kinahan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA solicitor from Northern Ireland is to
OL,7,Frepresent suspected mob boss Daniel
OL,8,FKinahan before the Irish courts in
OL,9,FDublin.
OL,11,FA defence barrister David Perry told
OL,12,Fthe Special Criminal Court on Monday
OL,13,Fthat Darragh Mackin would be Kinahan's
OL,14,Fdefence solicitor.
OL,16,FKinahan, 49, appeared before court by
OL,17,Fvideolink from Portlaoise Prison for
OL,18,Fthe second time as he faces a charge of
OL,19,Fdirecting the activities of a criminal
OL,20,Forganisation.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
